        }
      ],
      "redirectWhen": []
    },
    {
      "id": "moor_wenna_green_told",
      "says": [
        {
          "text": "The friendliness goes out of her, not unkindly. “Two nights a year. When the wind comes off the moor instead of the vale.” She looks at the door. “Everybody is inside by dark. Nobody rings a bell and nobody knocks and nobody has ever said out loud that we do it. I did it as a child before I knew I was doing it.”"
        }
      ],
      "onEnter": [
        {
          "learnLore": {
            "entry": "moor_fire_green"
          }
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "moor_wenna_green_on",
          "text": "Go on.",
          "goto": "greet",
          "effects": [],
          "onceOnly": false,
          "showWhenLocked": false,
          "lockedHint": ""
        }
      ],
      "redirectWhen": []
    },
    {
      "id": "moor_wenna_green_wont",
      "says": [
        {
          "text": "“I've said all I mean to,” they say, and go back to what they were doing."
        }
      ],
      "onEnter": [
        {
          "adjustReputation": {
            "faction": "the_library",
            "amount": -1
          }
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "moor_wenna_green_drop",
          "text": "Leave it.",
          "goto": "greet",
          "effects": [],
          "onceOnly": false,
          "showWhenLocked": false,
          "lockedHint": ""
        }
      ],
      "redirectWhen": []
    },
    {
      "id": "moor_wenna_rota_gave",
      "says": [
        {
          "text": "She hands it over in an oilcloth. “A hundred and sixty years of whose turn,” she says. “And two nights a year ruled straight through with nobody's name against them, every year, in every hand.” A beat. “Somebody keeps it those nights. It has never gone out.”"
        }
      ],
      "onEnter": [
        {
          "grantItem": {
            "target": {
              "ref": "actor.id"
            },
            "item": "hearth_rota",
            "quantity": 1
          }
        },
        {
          "setFlag": {
            "flag": "given:hearth_rota",
            "value": true
          }
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "moor_wenna_rota_thanks",
          "text": "Thank you.",
          "goto": "greet",
          "effects": [],
          "onceOnly": false,
          "showWhenLocked": false,
          "lockedHint": ""
        }
      ],
      "redirectWhen": []
    },
    {
      "id": "moor_wenna_rota_kept",
      "says": [
        {
          "text": "“It is the parish's and it is my turn,” Wenna says, and the oilcloth goes back in the dresser."
        }
